(7278576, 1133925, 83149, '<td valign="top">Really nice job, but I find the shadows distracting.  I think more even lighting and an overall brighter image would make the jewelry really pop on that white background.</td>', 'Really nice job, but I find the shadows distracting.  I think more even lighting and an overall brighter image would make the jewelry really pop on that white background.', '2014-10-31 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
