(7278581, 1133758, 83149, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I love the lighting on the cat, but I would like to see the jewelry much brighter.  It has too much competition for attention with the eyes.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I love the lighting on the cat, but I would like to see the jewelry much brighter.  It has too much competition for attention with the eyes.', '2014-10-31 10:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
