(7278691, 1133624, 124815, '<td valign="top">The idea is still worth pursuing. I find elbows being one of the most un-photogenic parts of the body and this one is no exception, (same fort the left shoulder blade) <br/>The wording shall also play second fiddle to the image.</td>', 'The idea is still worth pursuing. I find elbows being one of the most un-photogenic parts of the body and this one is no exception, (same fort the left shoulder blade) The wording shall also play second fiddle to the image.', '2014-10-31 15:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278696, 1133949, 70265, '<td valign="top">I think we have a winner. 10 because it''s one of the of only entries that could easily pass as an actual professional ad in my book  (I''m a graphic designer so I know ! LOL)</td>', 'I think we have a winner. 10 because it''s one of the of only entries that could easily pass as an actual professional ad in my book  (I''m a graphic designer so I know ! LOL)', '2014-10-31 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
