(7278705, 1134024, 96751, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait. But the crop, the flowing hair, and the very interesting eye, all pull me away from the earring. Perhaps a slight vignetting...</td>', 'A lovely portrait. But the crop, the flowing hair, and the very interesting eye, all pull me away from the earring. Perhaps a slight vignetting...', '2014-10-31 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
