(7278708, 1133972, 96751, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing image to be sure. I like the effect and the pp''g. As a stand-alone image, it''s awesome. As a "jewelry" image, The darker band in the middle finger MIGHT be jewelry... I guess I can think of this as a potential repository of jewelry.</td>', 'A very intriguing image to be sure. I like the effect and the pp''g. As a stand-alone image, it''s awesome. As a "jewelry" image, The darker band in the middle finger MIGHT be jewelry... I guess I can think of this as a potential repository of jewelry.', '2014-10-31 16:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278709, 1133968, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. But I feel the jewel is fighting for attention with the feather. I also think the diamonds might have benefited by adding a little sparkle to it :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors. But I feel the jewel is fighting for attention with the feather. I also think the diamonds might have benefited by adding a little sparkle to it :)', '2014-10-31 17:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278710, 1133866, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too much texture in the bottom blue</td>', 'Too much texture in the bottom blue', '2014-10-31 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
