(7278942, 1133973, 86447, '<td valign="top">I totally love every single thing about your advertisement.   <br/> <br/>Well... except the cat''s ears compete for the brightest part of your image and draw the eye too much away from the jewelry.<br/> <br/>The eyes are great...<br/> <br/>Love the light elsewhere and the sparkles!<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'I totally love every single thing about your advertisement.    Well... except the cat''s ears compete for the brightest part of your image and draw the eye too much away from the jewelry. The eyes are great... Love the light elsewhere and the sparkles! 9', '2014-11-01 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278943, 1133786, 86447, '<td valign="top">If I saw this image outside of the challenge topic, I''d not have any idea of what it was (without the title).   And... I have to say that even knowing the challenge topic, I''m not loving this.<br/> <br/>For a jewelry advertisement, I want to be able to discern it''s a jewel... and then WANT the jewel.  This does neither for me, I''m really sad to have to say.  <br/> <br/>5</td>', 'If I saw this image outside of the challenge topic, I''d not have any idea of what it was (without the title).   And... I have to say that even knowing the challenge topic, I''m not loving this. For a jewelry advertisement, I want to be able to discern it''s a jewel... and then WANT the jewel.  This does neither for me, I''m really sad to have to say.   5', '2014-11-01 21:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278944, 1133677, 86447, '<td valign="top">For a jewelry advertisement, the jewelry has to be tack sharp!  I struggled to read the lower left words... and I''m disappointed since I like everything about this "ad" except for the photograph.   But... it''s a photography challenge, in the end.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'For a jewelry advertisement, the jewelry has to be tack sharp!  I struggled to read the lower left words... and I''m disappointed since I like everything about this "ad" except for the photograph.   But... it''s a photography challenge, in the end. 6', '2014-11-01 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278945, 1134023, 86447, '<td valign="top">The words are sharper than the jewelry... not a good sign in a jewelry advertisement that''s supposed to be selling me something... and I can''t see it.<br/> <br/>Also, in general in photography, the brightest place in the image is where the eye goes first.   The corner of the book is the brightest spot.  I wish it were the clock face since the watch is fabulous!<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'The words are sharper than the jewelry... not a good sign in a jewelry advertisement that''s supposed to be selling me something... and I can''t see it. Also, in general in photography, the brightest place in the image is where the eye goes first.   The corner of the book is the brightest spot.  I wish it were the clock face since the watch is fabulous! 7', '2014-11-01 21:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278946, 1133624, 86447, '<td valign="top">I was loving this, until... I got to the "reflection".   Then you lost me.<br/> <br/>I love it if I crop the "water" out with my hand.<br/> <br/>For one, it''s not realistic enough and for the second, it makes her left elbow/arm very awkward.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see this without the alteration of the "water" and with the word not covering her head... perhaps on a layer behind her head?<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I was loving this, until... I got to the "reflection".   Then you lost me. I love it if I crop the "water" out with my hand. For one, it''s not realistic enough and for the second, it makes her left elbow/arm very awkward. I''d love to see this without the alteration of the "water" and with the word not covering her head... perhaps on a layer behind her head? 7', '2014-11-01 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278947, 1133987, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  <br/> <br/>I love the "reflection"... not at all fond of the "shadow".   <br/> <br/>The colors are wonderful and I love the white background and the fonts you''ve chosen.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.   I love the "reflection"... not at all fond of the "shadow".    The colors are wonderful and I love the white background and the fonts you''ve chosen. 8', '2014-11-01 21:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278948, 1133980, 86447, '<td valign="top">The pearls have to be tack sharp in an advertisement, I think.<br/> <br/>I love the composition and your arrangement of the scene.<br/> <br/>I really dislike your font and the harsh drop shadow.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'The pearls have to be tack sharp in an advertisement, I think. I love the composition and your arrangement of the scene. I really dislike your font and the harsh drop shadow. 7', '2014-11-01 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278949, 1133565, 86447, '<td valign="top">No.   Just ... no.<br/> <br/>LOL!<br/> <br/> <br/>6</td>', 'No.   Just ... no. LOL!  6', '2014-11-01 21:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278950, 1133963, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d really like to see what you''re advertising to get me to want to buy, but the shadows are so deep... I can''t see the main details.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I''d really like to see what you''re advertising to get me to want to buy, but the shadows are so deep... I can''t see the main details. 5', '2014-11-01 21:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278951, 1134024, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this idea!  And I love the hair blowing!<br/> <br/>I''d have cropped the top to the middle of the eyebrow... or even crop it to the middle of her eye...and made the earring be the brightest spot in the image to draw attention to the jewelry you''re trying to sell.<br/> <br/>The little bit of shadows where I assume her mouth is starting are a bit distracting, but if you crop in the horizontal middle of her eye, you could take off some of the right of the image too and that would get rid of those mouth shadows.    I''d also have cloned out the little bit of slit in her ear hole that makes me think the earring is going to be too heavy and cause slits in my ears.<br/> <br/>I sound like I really don''t like it, but that''s not true.  I DO love your idea here and it could be tweaked to be the winner of the challenge.<br/>8</td>', 'I love this idea!  And I love the hair blowing! I''d have cropped the top to the middle of the eyebrow... or even crop it to the middle of her eye...and made the earring be the brightest spot in the image to draw attention to the jewelry you''re trying to sell. The little bit of shadows where I assume her mouth is starting are a bit distracting, but if you crop in the horizontal middle of her eye, you could take off some of the right of the image too and that would get rid of those mouth shadows.    I''d also have cloned out the little bit of slit in her ear hole that makes me think the earring is going to be too heavy and cause slits in my ears. I sound like I really don''t like it, but that''s not true.  I DO love your idea here and it could be tweaked to be the winner of the challenge.8', '2014-11-01 21:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278952, 1133925, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colors!   The lighting does not highlight the jewelry enough, in my opinion, to be a professional advertisement for jewelry.   I''d like to see the jewelry steal the show in the image by making me not be able to look anywhere else in the image for long.<br/> <br/>As it is, the brightest spots of the image are the white display.   Make that jewelry POP out at me so much that I can''t ignore it!<br/>7</td>', 'Lovely composition and colors!   The lighting does not highlight the jewelry enough, in my opinion, to be a professional advertisement for jewelry.   I''d like to see the jewelry steal the show in the image by making me not be able to look anywhere else in the image for long. As it is, the brightest spots of the image are the white display.   Make that jewelry POP out at me so much that I can''t ignore it!7', '2014-11-01 21:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278953, 1133946, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like it... but I think the main part of the jewelry that you''re trying to sell to me should be in focus... especially since the shell is in focus.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I like it... but I think the main part of the jewelry that you''re trying to sell to me should be in focus... especially since the shell is in focus. 7', '2014-11-01 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278954, 1133976, 86447, '<td valign="top">I totally love the focus being so much on the jewelry (something so many did not do in this challenge) and that you''ve kept things simple... <br/> <br/>I also like the composition.   But... on my monitor, there are splotchy areas in the upper third and in the other white areas.<br/> <br/>I think a professional advertisement would have smoothed the skin a bit... especially the pointer finger knuckle which competes with the ring a bit in the focal range.<br/> <br/>Where the middle finger meets the fabric is an odd blob on my monitor. <br/> <br/>I know it sounds like I hate this image... LOL!   But, actually, it''s one of my favorites so far.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I totally love the focus being so much on the jewelry (something so many did not do in this challenge) and that you''ve kept things simple...  I also like the composition.   But... on my monitor, there are splotchy areas in the upper third and in the other white areas. I think a professional advertisement would have smoothed the skin a bit... especially the pointer finger knuckle which competes with the ring a bit in the focal range. Where the middle finger meets the fabric is an odd blob on my monitor.  I know it sounds like I hate this image... LOL!   But, actually, it''s one of my favorites so far. 7', '2014-11-01 21:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278955, 1133793, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t like your font... it needs to be able to be quickly read as I pass by your billboard or flip through my magazine to get to another article.  It needs to grab me, not make me struggle to read it. <br/> <br/>Also, the bright yellows in the watch band and the blown spots compete for my attention (and win) against the face of the watch.<br/> <br/>I do like your composition, although I would not have cropped it so close on the upper edge of the face of the watch.   <br/> <br/>I wish the face of the watch were the brightest spot in the whole image... so my attention would go there immediately and want to stay there... and buy your jewelry.  :D<br/> <br/>I love the angle of the watch at a tilt to make the advertisement not so rigid.   Good choice.   6</td>', 'I don''t like your font... it needs to be able to be quickly read as I pass by your billboard or flip through my magazine to get to another article.  It needs to grab me, not make me struggle to read it.  Also, the bright yellows in the watch band and the blown spots compete for my attention (and win) against the face of the watch. I do like your composition, although I would not have cropped it so close on the upper edge of the face of the watch.    I wish the face of the watch were the brightest spot in the whole image... so my attention would go there immediately and want to stay there... and buy your jewelry.  :D I love the angle of the watch at a tilt to make the advertisement not so rigid.   Good choice.   6', '2014-11-01 21:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278956, 1133968, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow, you did a great job on the making me like the jewelry you''re selling. <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, the "eye" of the peacock feather competes for my attention against the jewelry.  Cover the left peacock "eye" with your hand... and then view your ad.   It really makes the jewel pop out and grab the viewer''s attention.<br/> <br/>I love the DOF.  7</td>', 'Wow, you did a great job on the making me like the jewelry you''re selling.  Unfortunately, the "eye" of the peacock feather competes for my attention against the jewelry.  Cover the left peacock "eye" with your hand... and then view your ad.   It really makes the jewel pop out and grab the viewer''s attention. I love the DOF.  7', '2014-11-01 21:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278957, 1133866, 86447, '<td valign="top">I would have not had the upper word at all.   So... the first thing my eyes got to would be your great POP! of that gold jewelry making me want to buy it.<br/> <br/>Also, I''d have cloned out the imperfections in the blue at the bottom that are distracting.  6</td>', 'I would have not had the upper word at all.   So... the first thing my eyes got to would be your great POP! of that gold jewelry making me want to buy it. Also, I''d have cloned out the imperfections in the blue at the bottom that are distracting.  6', '2014-11-01 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278958, 1133530, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely job of it all!    <br/> <br/>I wish there were more sparkle to the jewelry... maybe even a fake starburst since it''s Expert Editing.<br/> <br/>But... this is my favorite so far!<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Lovely job of it all!     I wish there were more sparkle to the jewelry... maybe even a fake starburst since it''s Expert Editing. But... this is my favorite so far! 8', '2014-11-01 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278959, 1133758, 86447, '<td valign="top">The text adds too much, in my opinion.   If the advertisement were just that wonderful shot of the cat and the jewel (maybe with more sparkle on the jewelry so it doesn''t compete so much with the eyes for attention) and then... after you''d totally captivated me... I''d go down to read the tiny text about what you''re selling.<br/> <br/>As it is, the text so overwhelm me and the eyes are so in focus, that I barely get to the jewelry itself.<br/> <br/>Still... going on photography alone, this is among my top few.  <br/> <br/>8 as shown.   9 without the text.   10 if the jewelry were the sharpest part of the image.</td>', 'The text adds too much, in my opinion.   If the advertisement were just that wonderful shot of the cat and the jewel (maybe with more sparkle on the jewelry so it doesn''t compete so much with the eyes for attention) and then... after you''d totally captivated me... I''d go down to read the tiny text about what you''re selling. As it is, the text so overwhelm me and the eyes are so in focus, that I barely get to the jewelry itself. Still... going on photography alone, this is among my top few.   8 as shown.   9 without the text.   10 if the jewelry were the sharpest part of the image.', '2014-11-01 21:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278960, 1133988, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and the message.  I wish the jewelry stood out more.  I think the noise is making it recede into the background instead of popping out and making me want to buy it. 7</td>', 'I like your composition and the message.  I wish the jewelry stood out more.  I think the noise is making it recede into the background instead of popping out and making me want to buy it. 7', '2014-11-01 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278961, 1133759, 86447, '<td valign="top">Well done.   Could be a bit more light on the front of the jewelry since there is so much in the background making that fabulous bokeh, in my opinion.  7</td>', 'Well done.   Could be a bit more light on the front of the jewelry since there is so much in the background making that fabulous bokeh, in my opinion.  7', '2014-11-01 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278962, 1134017, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image!<br/> <br/>I wish the jewelry were just a bit more in focus to really make me be able to see it and want to buy it.   It doesn''t have to be sharply in focus... but a bit more, in my opinion.<br/> <br/> <br/>Still... one of the best in the bunch!<br/>8</td>', 'Fabulous image! I wish the jewelry were just a bit more in focus to really make me be able to see it and want to buy it.   It doesn''t have to be sharply in focus... but a bit more, in my opinion.  Still... one of the best in the bunch!8', '2014-11-01 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278963, 1134022, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the border.<br/> <br/>I do like the mood.<br/> <br/>Is that a potato the jewelry is on?<br/> <br/> <br/>I think the text should be more subdued to match the mood.  As is, it competes against the jewelry for my attention (and wins).<br/>7</td>', 'I don''t like the border. I do like the mood. Is that a potato the jewelry is on?  I think the text should be more subdued to match the mood.  As is, it competes against the jewelry for my attention (and wins).7', '2014-11-01 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279117, 1133976, 176157, '<td valign="top">Nice.  And the title is perfect.</td>', 'Nice.  And the title is perfect.', '2014-11-02 09:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279118, 1133925, 176157, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2014-11-02 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279120, 1133624, 176157, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph. I''m no expert, but everything seems in sync and working together very well.  I like what you did here.</td>', 'Awesome photograph. I''m no expert, but everything seems in sync and working together very well.  I like what you did here.', '2014-11-02 09:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279144, 1133925, 43565, '<td valign="top">Simple, with good focus. Maybe try different lighting to have less shadows. 7</td>', 'Simple, with good focus. Maybe try different lighting to have less shadows. 7', '2014-11-02 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279145, 1133946, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I find the shadows a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice concept. I find the shadows a little distracting.', '2014-11-02 11:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279146, 1133968, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, but I find the colors and pattern of the feathers distracting.</td>', 'Nice DOF, but I find the colors and pattern of the feathers distracting.', '2014-11-02 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279147, 1133976, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I would like to see the rings sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea. I would like to see the rings sharper.', '2014-11-02 11:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279149, 1134024, 43565, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but something bothers me about her eye.</td>', 'Interesting, but something bothers me about her eye.', '2014-11-02 11:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279151, 1133985, 43565, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the textured background is distracting and the lighting is a bit harsh. I would also like to see sharper focus on the jewelry.</td>', 'In my opinion, the textured background is distracting and the lighting is a bit harsh. I would also like to see sharper focus on the jewelry.', '2014-11-02 11:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279152, 1133866, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity.</td>', 'I like the simplicity.', '2014-11-02 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279155, 1134017, 102315, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic idea. The image is perfect and the text ties it all together. The only issue is that the product you are trying to sell is out of focus.</td>', 'This is a fantastic idea. The image is perfect and the text ties it all together. The only issue is that the product you are trying to sell is out of focus.', '2014-11-02 11:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279156, 1133949, 102315, '<td valign="top">I can see this being in a magazine ad. Perfect.</td>', 'I can see this being in a magazine ad. Perfect.', '2014-11-02 11:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279158, 1133530, 102315, '<td valign="top">Odd choice of prop unless I am missing the connection here.Sharp clear image with product in focus.</td>', 'Odd choice of prop unless I am missing the connection here.Sharp clear image with product in focus.', '2014-11-02 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279178, 1134026, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but find the ornaments distracting. Perhaps a shallower DOF and less reflection of the light would help.</td>', 'I like the idea, but find the ornaments distracting. Perhaps a shallower DOF and less reflection of the light would help.', '2014-11-02 13:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279179, 1133662, 43565, '<td valign="top">Love the watch and text, but I am distracted by the background.</td>', 'Love the watch and text, but I am distracted by the background.', '2014-11-02 13:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279180, 1133837, 43565, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity. I think the focus could be a little sharper. The text being small and in the corner doesn''t work for me, but I understand why you did it. 5</td>', 'Like the simplicity. I think the focus could be a little sharper. The text being small and in the corner doesn''t work for me, but I understand why you did it. 5', '2014-11-02 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279181, 1133624, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Might have been more effective if you had included her head in the reflection.</td>', 'I like the idea. Might have been more effective if you had included her head in the reflection.', '2014-11-02 13:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279182, 1133743, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but it is hard to know what you are trying to sell. (Of course, there are a lot of ads like that today...)</td>', 'Nice macro, but it is hard to know what you are trying to sell. (Of course, there are a lot of ads like that today...)', '2014-11-02 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279183, 1133530, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the text and simplicity, but not sure what the donkey (horse?) represents.</td>', 'I like the text and simplicity, but not sure what the donkey (horse?) represents.', '2014-11-02 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279184, 1134023, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using a book. For me, it ends up a little busy, there is no connection between the text and the watch, and the partial flower is distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea of using a book. For me, it ends up a little busy, there is no connection between the text and the watch, and the partial flower is distracting.', '2014-11-02 13:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279185, 1133988, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the font you selected. I think it would work better if it was not grainy.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the font you selected. I think it would work better if it was not grainy.', '2014-11-02 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279186, 1133525, 43565, '<td valign="top">For me, there are too many pieces of jewelry included. I like the star-bursts in the text, but would prefer less on the jewelry. Since the title is "Dragonfly" the focus could have been on that piece.</td>', 'For me, there are too many pieces of jewelry included. I like the star-bursts in the text, but would prefer less on the jewelry. Since the title is "Dragonfly" the focus could have been on that piece.', '2014-11-02 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279187, 1133819, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but this does not work as a jewelry advertisement for me.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but this does not work as a jewelry advertisement for me.', '2014-11-02 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279188, 1134022, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, this is too dark, although it might work if it had just been the pearls. Not sure what the red object is or why it is included.</td>', 'To me, this is too dark, although it might work if it had just been the pearls. Not sure what the red object is or why it is included.', '2014-11-02 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279189, 1133786, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, but does not work as a jewelry advertisement for me.</td>', 'This is interesting, but does not work as a jewelry advertisement for me.', '2014-11-02 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279190, 1133565, 43565, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but this looks created in Photoshop, especially where the jewels are cut off. I don''t think this would work as an ad.</td>', 'Just my opinion, but this looks created in Photoshop, especially where the jewels are cut off. I don''t think this would work as an ad.', '2014-11-02 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279191, 1133980, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I would like to see the pearls more in focus. The three words being spread apart and black draw my attention away from the pearls and shells. Perhaps in a light tan across the bottom?</td>', 'Good idea. I would like to see the pearls more in focus. The three words being spread apart and black draw my attention away from the pearls and shells. Perhaps in a light tan across the bottom?', '2014-11-02 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279504, 1133980, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good looking arrangement, I like the texture on the background and the lettering as well.</td>', 'Good looking arrangement, I like the texture on the background and the lettering as well.', '2014-11-03 09:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279506, 1133972, 13077, '<td valign="top">The new invisible rings, now "70% off" but still twice as expensive as the old ones...</td>', 'The new invisible rings, now "70% off" but still twice as expensive as the old ones...', '2014-11-03 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279508, 1134022, 13077, '<td valign="top">The color scheme is nice, and I like the low-key look, but there''s a little motion blur in the photo you used.</td>', 'The color scheme is nice, and I like the low-key look, but there''s a little motion blur in the photo you used.', '2014-11-03 09:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279515, 1133925, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and how the necklace almost seems to glow.</td>', 'I like the lighting and how the necklace almost seems to glow.', '2014-11-03 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279518, 1133819, 13077, '<td valign="top">Attractive composition. If only someone could harness it and turn it into jewelry?</td>', 'Attractive composition. If only someone could harness it and turn it into jewelry?', '2014-11-03 09:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279520, 1133985, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not too bad - I wish the jewelry looked a little more "real", the effect on the background looks good but I don''t think it improves the look of the jewelry.</td>', 'Not too bad - I wish the jewelry looked a little more "real", the effect on the background looks good but I don''t think it improves the look of the jewelry.', '2014-11-03 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279521, 1133976, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. True to the title.</td>', 'Nice. True to the title.', '2014-11-03 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279523, 1133946, 13077, '<td valign="top">Has a very old-fashioned ad vibe to it - nicely done.</td>', 'Has a very old-fashioned ad vibe to it - nicely done.', '2014-11-03 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279524, 1133949, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I really like the effect of the water stream ''wearing'' the watch.</td>', 'Nicely done. I really like the effect of the water stream ''wearing'' the watch.', '2014-11-03 09:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279525, 1134023, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - cool arrangement and nice soft light.</td>', 'Nicely done - cool arrangement and nice soft light.', '2014-11-03 09:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279526, 1133866, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lettering, but the little pieces of thread stuck to the surface in the foreground are pretty distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition and the lettering, but the little pieces of thread stuck to the surface in the foreground are pretty distracting.', '2014-11-03 09:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279527, 1133758, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent job. Beautiful simple color scheme, everything is well placed and the photo used is top-notch.</td>', 'Excellent job. Beautiful simple color scheme, everything is well placed and the photo used is top-notch.', '2014-11-03 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279529, 1133786, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. Such a mysterious photo, and good wording.</td>', 'I like it. Such a mysterious photo, and good wording.', '2014-11-03 09:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279531, 1133743, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent details, well composed and lit.</td>', 'Excellent details, well composed and lit.', '2014-11-03 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279532, 1133530, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Looks classy, I like the simplicity.</td>', 'Very cute. Looks classy, I like the simplicity.', '2014-11-03 09:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279534, 1133973, 13077, '<td valign="top">Super cool. Can''t critique anything on this because it''s way beyond my skill level, excellent job with this processing and creating such a mystical and surreal atmosphere.<br/>That''s a really cool looking cat, too.</td>', 'Super cool. Can''t critique anything on this because it''s way beyond my skill level, excellent job with this processing and creating such a mystical and surreal atmosphere.That''s a really cool looking cat, too.', '2014-11-03 09:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279537, 1133988, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - good classic vibe to this one. I like the grain, good job with the lighting and lettering too.</td>', 'Nice - good classic vibe to this one. I like the grain, good job with the lighting and lettering too.', '2014-11-03 09:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279539, 1133968, 13077, '<td valign="top">Super cool. I really like the colors and perfect amount of DOF here. I think having the words further apart might have been nice, though - like having the "passion" on the left, "pride" in the center and "perfection" on the right.</td>', 'Super cool. I really like the colors and perfect amount of DOF here. I think having the words further apart might have been nice, though - like having the "passion" on the left, "pride" in the center and "perfection" on the right.', '2014-11-03 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279540, 1133987, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - simple and clean, and good lettering.</td>', 'Nice - simple and clean, and good lettering.', '2014-11-03 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279541, 1133677, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - well arranged and good looking design.</td>', 'Nice - well arranged and good looking design.', '2014-11-03 09:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279544, 1134026, 13077, '<td valign="top">The arrangement is nice, but the photo is a bit soft.</td>', 'The arrangement is nice, but the photo is a bit soft.', '2014-11-03 10:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279545, 1133759, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice jewelry, also nice background to shoot it in front of.</td>', 'Nice jewelry, also nice background to shoot it in front of.', '2014-11-03 10:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279553, 1133957, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good lo-fi look which works well for this shapely &amp; contrasty scene, but I don''t get the jewelry theme.</td>', 'Good lo-fi look which works well for this shapely & contrasty scene, but I don''t get the jewelry theme.', '2014-11-03 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1);
