(7279554, 1134024, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. Excellent details and tones, and exciting composition. I''m wondering if you had something blowing her hair back, or is it gravity and it was rotated?</td>', 'Nice. Excellent details and tones, and exciting composition. I''m wondering if you had something blowing her hair back, or is it gravity and it was rotated?', '2014-11-03 10:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
