(7280176, 1133525, 156466, '<td valign="top">Draw a diagonal from the bottom left to upper right.  Everything above the line is wonderful.  Really nicely done.  Below the line?  The bokeh/blry on the bottom of the dragonfly wings is extremely distracting, as is the forced blur white wash.  Top half gets and 8, bottom half gets a 4.  Do the math.</td>', 'Draw a diagonal from the bottom left to upper right.  Everything above the line is wonderful.  Really nicely done.  Below the line?  The bokeh/blry on the bottom of the dragonfly wings is extremely distracting, as is the forced blur white wash.  Top half gets and 8, bottom half gets a 4.  Do the math.', '2014-11-05 08:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280178, 1133624, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice edit, but the jewelry doesn''t quite pop the way I''d want it to for an ad. It''s too far back in the frame, and it feels too close to the "water".</td>', 'Nice edit, but the jewelry doesn''t quite pop the way I''d want it to for an ad. It''s too far back in the frame, and it feels too close to the "water".', '2014-11-05 08:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
