(7280934, 1133925, 47974, '<td valign="top">Was shot on a slight angle (which is fine) but you cropped it square and tried to make it look centered.  It is off just enough to be noticeable but not enough to make it look good/ok.  A rectangular crop with space for wording would have worked much better.</td>', 'Was shot on a slight angle (which is fine) but you cropped it square and tried to make it look centered.  It is off just enough to be noticeable but not enough to make it look good/ok.  A rectangular crop with space for wording would have worked much better.', '2014-11-06 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280936, 1134026, 47974, '<td valign="top">Image looks soft or out of focus.......would have been more effective if the diamonds were sharp and like saying "Look at us, are we not just so pretty"</td>', 'Image looks soft or out of focus.......would have been more effective if the diamonds were sharp and like saying "Look at us, are we not just so pretty"', '2014-11-06 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
