(7280945, 1133677, 47974, '<td valign="top">The pile of stuff is to busy and none of it seems to really be in focus.  Would have been more effective if you had something tack sharp with a really small DOF and everything else blurred.  Like move the charm from the bottom left up and had it in perfect focus.</td>', 'The pile of stuff is to busy and none of it seems to really be in focus.  Would have been more effective if you had something tack sharp with a really small DOF and everything else blurred.  Like move the charm from the bottom left up and had it in perfect focus.', '2014-11-06 11:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
