(7281149, 1133793, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph quite a bit.  Maybe the highlights are a little too bright for my taste, but the face of the watch is nice.  I would have used a different font, though.</td>', 'I like the photograph quite a bit.  Maybe the highlights are a little too bright for my taste, but the face of the watch is nice.  I would have used a different font, though.', '2014-11-06 17:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281150, 1133530, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the image and the clarity of the jewelry, the colors you''ve used, and the fade on the back end of the animal and across the photo.  However, I think you have too much negative space in the upper right quadrant for my taste.  My eyes keep wandering up to that emptiness, expecting to see text or something more.  Still, it''s a fine image.</td>', 'I like the image and the clarity of the jewelry, the colors you''ve used, and the fade on the back end of the animal and across the photo.  However, I think you have too much negative space in the upper right quadrant for my taste.  My eyes keep wandering up to that emptiness, expecting to see text or something more.  Still, it''s a fine image.', '2014-11-06 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281152, 1133624, 37858, '<td valign="top">There''s much to like here.  Very creative use of water and reflection.  The image is a bit dark, though; I suspect to contrast with the pearls. It''s also a bit unusual to see the necklaces hanging down her back rather than having her face the camera and wearing them more conventionally.  I really like the way the water merges with the background, too.</td>', 'There''s much to like here.  Very creative use of water and reflection.  The image is a bit dark, though; I suspect to contrast with the pearls. It''s also a bit unusual to see the necklaces hanging down her back rather than having her face the camera and wearing them more conventionally.  I really like the way the water merges with the background, too.', '2014-11-06 17:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281153, 1133973, 37858, '<td valign="top">My favorite image in this challenge.  I love the lighting and the colors.</td>', 'My favorite image in this challenge.  I love the lighting and the colors.', '2014-11-06 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
